# ROM images and emulator state. Binaries never go in the tree; the authoritative md5s
# and the one-command rebuild are in docs/RELEASE_zh.md, and the placement rule (only the
# master + the delivered patch in the project root, everything else in ~/retro/roms/) is
# AGENTS.md section 1.
*.sfc
*.smc
*.srm
*.ips
*.bps
*.xdelta

# Derived dumps of the Japanese ROM. Regenerate with tools/extract_all.py (out/script),
# tools/dump_text.py (out/text) and tools/extract_font.py (out/font).
out/

# 18 MB of third-party fan-translation material, read-only input, not ours to version.
reference/

# Extracted Japanese script queue for future batches; written by tools/translate_batch.py.
translations/pending.json

# Render evidence regenerated by tools/prologue_shots.py from an emulator walk.
# index.txt (the transcript) IS tracked. The 乱码 screenshots that motivated the rebuild are
# tracked too -- they cannot be recreated -- but they live in docs/history/ now (non-authoritative).
docs/prologue_zh/*.png
# Same for render_prologue.py's per-block output dirs: box_*.png + sheets are pure
# derived evidence (labels.txt is what the gate reads), regenerate with one command.
docs/research/render_rom_prologue_zh*/

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
.zcode/

# Per-block derived data. 中文正文（blockN_zh.txt）是要入库的，下面这些不是：
# 全部由 tools/block_work.py（_work.tsv / _work.json）和构建本身（_enc.json）重生成。
docs/research/*_work.json
docs/research/*_jp.txt
docs/research/*_enc.json
docs/research/*_seg.txt
# AppleDouble sidecars from macOS file transfers.
._*
